Grande/MMLU — is this a problem?\n5. **Reproducibility**: Can this be reproduced from the description? Is the model zoo public?\n6. **Confounds and threats to validity**: Training token confound, n=3 architectures, n=6 benchmarks for dose-response.\n\n## Output Format\nProvide a structured review:\n\n### Summary\n(2-3 sentences)\n\n### Strengths (S1-S5)\n### Weaknesses (W1-W5)\n### Questions for Authors (Q1-Q3)\n### Minor Issues\n\n### Preliminary Scores (before roundtable discussion)\n- Soundness: X/5\n- Excitement: X/5  \n- Reproducibility: X/5\n- Overall Assessment: X/5 (use half-point scale)\n- Confidence: X/5\n\nBe rigorous and calibrated. This is EMNLP 2026 — Main acceptance ~21%."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01L57mAV5pGsec2Hdwg7ipUS","session_id":"02a6161e-0620-4daa-b839-56fba4fba1ab","uuid":"408c80d7-5ed7-4441-a75d-b0a865909239","timestamp":"2026-05-19T14:23:41.610Z"}
