his supported?\n6. **Writing quality**: Is the paper clear, well-structured, properly scoped?\n\n## Output Format\nProvide a structured review:\n\n### Summary\n(2-3 sentences)\n\n### Strengths (S1-S5)\n### Weaknesses (W1-W5)\n### Questions for Authors (Q1-Q3)\n### Minor Issues\n\n### Preliminary Scores (before roundtable discussion)\n- Soundness: X/5\n- Excitement: X/5\n- Reproducibility: X/5\n- Overall Assessment: X/5 (use half-point scale)\n- Confidence: X/5\n\nBe rigorous and calibrated. EMNLP 2026 Main acceptance ~21%."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018qEKYB4hX9YRK8BSpFTN6r","session_id":"02a6161e-0620-4daa-b839-56fba4fba1ab","uuid":"2242ea17-2b64-4850-946d-cedd49cd8fd7","timestamp":"2026-05-19T14:24:04.419Z"}
