{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018dwZxkaeUSF7cNzfmtgw1n","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 entrainment_gated_ft 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (10 个)\\n\\n- **exp-003-p2v2**: PREPARING (killed) — \\n- **exp-008**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-011**: PREPARING — \\n- **exp-003-p2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-003**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-001**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-009**: DONE (success) — \\n- **eval_340m_retnet_hgrn2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **hgrn2_eval_h3_1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **hgrn2_eval_1_3b_all**: DONE (killed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-19\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp-003-p2v2: Helped samples have higher pure-model perplexity (model uncertain → attention helped) while hurt samples have lower perplexity (model confident → attention interfered), with architecture-specific patterns across GDN/RetNet/HGRN2. Retry with HGRN2 monkey-patch fix for _tied_weights_keys AttributeError.（准备中）\\n- exp-011: Cross-architecture variance on additional retrieval-dependent benchmarks (StoryCloze, BoolQ, COPA, PIQA, SciQ) decreases monotonically with attention ratio, providing a second statistically significant anchor (exact permutation p<0.05, two-tailed) beyond LAMBADA after Bonferroni correction（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp-008** (success): Replacing scipy.stats.spearmanr asymptotic p-values with exact permutation tests (n=5, 120 permutations, two-tailed) corrects the spurious p=1.4e-24 bug; expected: LAMBADA raw p≈0.017, Bonferroni adj-p≈0.100 (not significant), confirming need for additional benchmarks ← 基于 exp-001\\n- **exp-003-p2** (negative): Helped samples have higher pure-model perplexity (model was uncertain → attention helped), while hurt samples have lower pure-model perplexity (model was confident → attention interfered). This pattern is architecture-specific. ← 基于 exp-003\\n  [exp-003-p2 statistical summary](/api/workspace-files/projects/entra